Package: iceland-pencild
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, bluez, libinput10, udev
Description: OPPO Pencil BLE and NT36536 touchscreen bridge for Iceland
 Forward pencil timing, pressure and button data between BlueZ and the
 NT36536 kernel control interface. Install the systemd service and the
 libinput and udev configuration for the integrated pen digitizer.
